            <note corresp="#d201-f4" n="4" xml:id="d201-f4-content">
                <p>In a May 21 letter to Carlucci, Shultz wrote that he had “directed that the
                    Interagency Group on Oceans Policy and Law of the Sea be convened soon to
                    consider the matter.” (Reagan Library, Papers of George P. Shultz, Law of the Sea)</p>
            </note>
